# Keeps the Vercel upload to source, not build output.
#
# `docs/` is deliberately NOT ignored: apps/web imports the published handoff
# artifacts under docs/buildx-orion-2026/outputs/05-build/frontend-handoff/
# directly, so excluding it would break the build.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
out
**/out
test-results
**/test-results
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
.git
.secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.tsbuildinfo
contracts/out
contracts/cache
contracts/broadcast
# Vendored Foundry dependencies, committed since 2026-08-21 so `forge test` works
# from a bare clone. 3.2 MB of Solidity the web build never reads.
contracts/lib
